# Never commit anyone's tax documents or generated filings
itr-wala-workspace/
*AIS*
*26AS*
*Form16*
*form16*
*TIS*
*Challan*
*ACK*
*.ack
income.json
computation.json
computation.txt
filing-pack.md

# The patterns above match by NAME, so they also swallow the skill's own
# source - decrypt_ais.py, parse_26as.py, extract_tis.py and friends are named
# for the documents they read. Re-include skill source explicitly. Code and
# docs ONLY - never .json: decrypt_ais.py's default output is AIS-decrypted.json
# and the engine reads income.json, so a data re-include would make the most
# sensitive files in the system committable. (example-income.json is already
# tracked; ignore rules do not apply to tracked files.)
!skills/**/*.py
!skills/**/*.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
